建議申報與審查原則如下:  \n（1） 適應症：初次檢查限具有心衰竭症狀，理學檢查異常，且心電 \n圖（或胸部X 光)結果異常，經臨床診斷為 Functional Class \nIII 以上之心臟衰竭。 \n（2） 治療 1-3 個月後得追蹤檢驗；病情穩定後，每六個月得檢一 \n次。 \n決議：照案通過，如說明段。 \n \n \n肆、散會：下午1 時30 分 \n \n \n \n \n \n","low_text":false,"independent_check":"NORMALIZED_EXACT","preview_url":"/api/meeting-preview/MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867/3.png"},{"page":4,"blocks":[{"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b1","block_number":1,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,47.216041564941406,95.36400604248047,63.17604064941406],"raw_text":"附件1: \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b2","block_number":2,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,77.23600006103516,567.4199829101562,93.19599914550781],"raw_text":"第 3 章 代謝及營養劑 Metabolic & nutrient agents （自 100 年 8 月 1 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b3","block_number":3,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,107.23600006103516,107.36400604248047,123.19599914550781],"raw_text":"日生效） \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b4","block_number":4,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,137.23599243164062,567.4199829101562,153.1959991455078],"raw_text":"3.2.1.Mecobalamin 製劑：(85/4/1、 100/8/1) 限符合以下條件之一使用： \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b5","block_number":5,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,167.23599243164062,567.4199829101562,183.1959991455078],"raw_text":"1. 糖尿病併發周邊神經病變並 具有臨床神經學病徵 (須於處 方上敘明)。 \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b6","block_number":6,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,197.23599243164062,547.2457275390625,213.1959991455078],"raw_text":"2. 經神經科專科醫師診斷或經 神經傳導(NCV) 檢查證實之慢性多發性神\n"},{"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b7","block_number":7,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,227.23599243164062,387.4900207519531,243.1959991455078],"raw_text":"經病變(chronic polyneuropathy)。（100/8/1） \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b8","block_number":8,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,257.2660217285156,43.380001068115234,273.22601318359375],"raw_text":" \n"},{"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p4-b9","block_number":9,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,287.2660217285156,103.40